<title>UK: Citi forms group for $80 mln Liu Chong Hing FRCD.</title>
<headline>Citi forms group for $80 mln Liu Chong Hing FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp International said on Thursday it has formed an arranger group for a $80 million FRCD for Liu Chong Hing Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>The issue has a five-year maturity with a put option to holders exercisable on the third anniversary of the deposit rate. The FRCDs carry a 0.40 percent per annum margin over six-month Libor.</p>
<p>Bayerische Landesbank GZ, Standard Chartered Bank, Westdeutsche Landesbank GZ and Westpac Banking Corp join Citicorp as arrangers.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
